import * as THREE from 'three/webgpu';import {createEngine,installProjectRules,parseProject} from '@zge/sdk';import {createViewport} from '@zge/sdk/three';import {projectFor,kinds} from './projects.mjs';let e,s;const keys=new Set(),canvas=document.querySelector('canvas'),view=await createViewport({three:THREE,canvas});async function open(p){await e?.dispose();e=await createEngine({project:p});s=await e.loadWorld();const assets=[];for(const a of p.assets.filter(a=>a.type==='static-model')){const l=await e.acquireAsset(a.id);assets.push({...a,data:l.instantiate()});l.release();}view.setModelAssets(assets);installProjectRules(e,keys);await e.start();window.game={engine:e,scene:s,viewport:view};document.querySelector('#title').textContent=p.name;}await open(await projectFor(new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('game')||kinds[0]));document.querySelector('#import').onchange=async event=>open(parseProject(await event.target.files[0].text()));document.querySelector('#save').onclick=()=>{localStorage.setItem('game',JSON.stringify(e.exportProject()));document.querySelector('#status').textContent='Saved';};document.querySelector('#reload').onclick=async()=>{await open(parseProject(localStorage.getItem('game')));document.querySelector('#status').textContent='Restored';};addEventListener('keydown',event=>{if(!['INPUT','BUTTON'].includes(event.target.tagName)){event.preventDefault();keys.add(event.key);}});addEventListener('keyup',event=>keys.delete(event.key));addEventListener('blur',()=>keys.clear());function frame(t){e.frame(t);view.sync(s.entities());view.render();document.querySelector('#status').textContent=s.findEntity('goal')?.components.goal.complete?'Objective complete':'Find supply';requestAnimationFrame(frame);}requestAnimationFrame(frame);addEventListener('pagehide',()=>{view.dispose();e.dispose();},{once:true});